  "hints": [
    "Half the traffic is images. Should those ever reach your servers?",
    "Best-sellers get most views, so a cache in front of the database does most of the work.",
    "CloudFront → LB (2) → API (8) → Redis (2, 32 GB) → Postgres (4 replicas)."
  ],
