  "explanation": [
    "Put images (and other static assets) on a CDN with long cache lifetimes and versioned URLs.",
    "Cache product pages by id; invalidate an entry when a merchant edits that product.",
    "A relational database with a read replica is plenty once the cache absorbs the hot reads."
